{"id":"301cfe50f6e97873","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-mu-recursive.md","title":"Mu Recursive Function","display":"df-mu-recursive — Mu Recursive Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-mu-recursive","aliases":["92-df-mu-recursive"],"display":"df-mu-recursive — Mu Recursive Function","depends_on":["[[92-df-recursive-function]]"],"source":"原书第 IV 章附录 pp. 53–54（PDF 70–71）；μ 闭包为本地补充","source_status":"原书递归概念的本地计算模型呈现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-mu-recursive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-mu-recursive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mu-recursive — Mu Recursive Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书第 IV 章附录 pp. 53–54（PDF 70–71）；μ 闭包为本地补充"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书递归概念的本地计算模型呈现"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-mu-recursive-—-Mu-Recursive-Function-$\\mu$\">df-mu-recursive — Mu Recursive Function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\)</span> (partial function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartRec}\\)</span> (partial-recursive function class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MuRecursive}\">\\(\\mathrm{MuRecursive}\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mu\\text{-}recursive} \\vdash \\mathrm{MuRecursive}(f)\\leftrightarrow f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mu\\text{-}recursive} \\vdash \\mathrm{MuRecursive}(f)\\leftrightarrow f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu g\">\\(\\mu g\\)</span> : μ递归（最小化运算）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>寻找使<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>等于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>的最小<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span></li>\n<li>μ递归函数可能不是全函数（部分函数）</li>\n<li>递归函数 = 原始递归函数 + μ运算</li>\n<li>例如，对部分递归 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(\\vec x,m)\">\\(g(\\vec x,m)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu m\\,[g(\\vec x,m)=0]\">\\(\\mu m\\,[g(\\vec x,m)=0]\\)</span> 搜索最小零点；若更早的计算发散或不存在零点，所得函数可不定义</li>\n<li>部分 μ 递归函数与固定形式图灵机模型的部分可计算函数等价，这是模型间的数学定理；将非形式的“有效可计算”同这些模型对应才是 Church–Turing 论题</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>原书直接用关系及其补集都 Σ₁ 定义 recursive，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cc77d3ecb4f82cf1\" href=\"?note=cc77d3ecb4f82cf1\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations\">92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations</a>；未在这两页建立 μ 闭包与图灵模型的完整等价证明。本文 μ 闭包保留为本地递归论支线。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-mu-recursive-—-Mu-Recursive-Function-$\\mu$","text":"df-mu-recursive — Mu Recursive Function $\\mu$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ (partial-recursive function class, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations","status":"resolved","id":"cc77d3ecb4f82cf1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"原书直接用关系及其补集都 Σ₁ 定义 recursive，见 [[92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations]]；未在这两页建立 μ 闭包与图灵模型的完整等价证明。本文 μ 闭包保留为本地递归论支线。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartRec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MuRecursive}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mu\\text{-}recursive} \\vdash \\mathrm{MuRecursive}(f)\\leftrightarrow f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"g(\\vec x,m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu m\\,[g(\\vec x,m)=0]","display":false}],"bytes":1606,"backlinks":[{"id":"e09695d13f301942","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-109","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-mu-recursive]]"}],"outgoing":["d65795dc15ebce4b","cc77d3ecb4f82cf1"]}